  "meta": {
    "name": "aerodale",
    "worldSeed": 20260731,
    "prompt": "Aerodale is a dense modern resort city laid out on five shelves of gentle upland. A glass downtown of towers, offices, a hotel, apartments, a penthouse terrace, an atrium block and a brutalist civic slab rings a paved plaza, with the car park, filling station, corner shop and data centre out on the service road and a villa on the hill above. East of it a wide apron carries the airfield: a runway, hangars, the whole parked fleet from a biplane to an airliner, an airship at its mooring mast, and the control tower and terminal fronting the strip. North, a science campus climbs a shelf of domes, laboratories, glasshouses and a seed vault. South along the lake runs a leisure strip of theatres, baths, gyms and a lido, and west the fairground packs a big top, a ferris wheel and a full midway. It is deliberately crowded: this is a city built to be walked end to end in an afternoon.",
    "spawn": {
      "zone": "center"
    }
  },
